# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in your keys, or export the
# variables in your shell. ResumesUX reads each provider's API key from the
# environment as:
#
#   RESUMESUX_<PROVIDER_NAME>_KEY
#
# where <PROVIDER_NAME> is the config.yaml provider key, uppercased with any
# non-alphanumeric character turned into `_` (e.g. `lmstudio`, `open-ai` ->
# LMSTUDIO / OPEN_AI). A key that is empty/unset is sent unauthenticated
# (fine for local LM Studio/Ollama; required for hosted providers).

RESUMESUX_LMSTUDIO_KEY=
# RESUMESUX_OPENAI_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxx
# RESUMESUX_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxx
